+it("capability 응답 대기 중 연결이 바뀌면 이전 셀 상태와 쿼리 요청을 적용하지 않는다", async () => {
+  // Given
+  let started: (() => void) | undefined;
+  let finish: ((value: { service_protocol: number; operations: string[] }) => void) | undefined;
+  const waiting = new Promise<void>((resolve) => { started = resolve; });
+  service.capabilities.mockImplementationOnce(() => { started?.(); return new Promise((resolve) => { finish = resolve; }); });
+  const original = tab();
+  const view = render(<NotebookView tab={original} updateTab={vi.fn()} connectionId="conn-notebook" isActive />);
+  const scenario = async () => {
+    await act(async () => {
